lecccion 7-Why /Because- Who

1-Para preguntar: Why: Por que?

2-Para responder: Because : Porque.

3-Why not?: Porque no?.

#Exaples:

1-Why are you studying English?
Because I want to travel

2- Why aren't you studying English?
Because I want rest.

3- Is the board black?
No, it isn't.
Why not?
Because the board is white.

Uso del Who
Quien? Quienes?

1-Who is painting the house?
  Who's
  Quien esta pintando la casa?

3-Who are watching a movie?
  Quienes estan viendo una pelicula?


Practice:

A. ¿ Porque esta Brayan en el banco?
   Why is Brayan in the bank?

B. Porque el esta retirando dinero.
   Because he's withdrawing money.

A. Quien es esa mujer?
   Who's that woman?

B. Ella es su hermana.
   She's his sister.


